        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "f71b46a9-bae7-fb05-c234-99864f354264"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Garvita: Hey.\nDon't. If you grab\nme we both go."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "3250f92c-6807-38ac-64b5-cc7448c2581b"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Garvita: Funny. I\nalways wanted to\nrun so far nobody",
          "could call me\nback."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "b446d11c-beb8-a6c8-6a8a-e876f2461d5f"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Garvita: ...it's\nnice that\nsomeone's waiting",
